    "verdict": {
      "html": "<div class=\"verdict\"><div class=\"pct ok\">+282%</div>\n     <div><p class=\"call\">Fique com ele.</p><p class=\"muted\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">SpATK do seu contra um Abra médio no mesmo nível. É o stat que define o dano dele.</p></div></div>\n   <div class=\"trio\"><div><small>Resistência vs médio</small><b>+444%</b></div><div><small>SpATK do máximo possível</small><b>209%</b></div><div><small>HP de combate</small><b>6.156</b></div></div>"
    },
    "stats": {
      "html": "<div class=\"radar-wrap\"><svg class=\"radar\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 280\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Radar dos stats contra o máximo\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"rg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"var(--t1)\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"var(--t2)\"/></linearGradient></defs>\n    <polygon points=\"150,30 245.26279441628824,85 245.26279441628827,194.99999999999997 150,250 54.73720558371177,195.00000000000003 54.737205583711756,84.99999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,57.5 221.4470958122162,98.75 221.4470958122162,181.25 150,222.5 78.55290418778382,181.25000000000003 78.55290418778381,98.74999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,85 197.6313972081441,112.5 197.63139720814414,167.5 150,195 102.36860279185589,167.50000000000003 102.36860279185588,112.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,112.5 173.81569860407205,126.25 173.81569860407205,153.75 150,167.5 126.18430139592795,153.75 126.18430139592795,126.25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n    <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628824\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628827\" y2=\"194.99999999999997\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.73720558371177\" y2=\"195.00000000000003\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.737205583711756\" y2=\"84.99999999999999\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,96.3 189.8,117.0 188.6,162.3 150.0,200.3 102.9,167.2 102.5,112.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink-2)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,-221.7 232.5,92.4 337.5,248.3 150.0,370.2 -0.9,227.1 -164.5,-41.6\" fill=\"url(#rg)\" fill-opacity=\".45\" stroke=\"url(#rg)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">HP</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">ATK</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"209.99999999999997\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">DEF</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"k\">SpATK</text><text x=\"35.684646700454124\" y=\"210.00000000000006\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SpDEF</text><text x=\"35.68464670045411\" y=\"77.99999999999999\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SPD</text></svg><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">HP</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"HP: seu 513, médio 62, máximo 156\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:190%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:22.962962962962962%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(57.77777777777778% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">513</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">ATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"ATK: seu 116, médio 56, máximo 134\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:42.96296296296296%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:20.74074074074074%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(49.629629629629626% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">116</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">DEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"DEF: seu 248, médio 51, máximo 126\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:91.85185185185185%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:18.88888888888889%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(46.666666666666664% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">248</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm key\">SpATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpATK: seu 565, médio 148, máximo 270\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:209.25925925925927%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:54.81481481481482%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(100% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">565</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SpDEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpDEF: seu 301, médio 94, máximo 190\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:111.48148148148148%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:34.81481481481482%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(70.37037037037037% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">301</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SPD</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SPD: seu 888, médio 134, máximo 269\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:328.8888888888889%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:49.629629629629626%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(99.62962962962963% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">888</span></div></div></div><p class=\"note\">Contorno tracejado no radar: exemplar médio. O ponto ao lado do nome marca o stat de ataque dele. Resistência é a média de HP, DEF e SpDEF contra o exemplar médio.</p>"
    },
    "imp": {
      "html": "<p style=\"margin:0\">Os golpes de dano dele são especiais: o <b>SpATK</b> (base 105) decide o dano. ATK só pesa na Investida, que é física.</p>\n   <div class=\"mins\">\n    <div><small>Qualidade mínima</small><b>1,3</b><span>sai em ~26% das capturas, cerca de 4</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de SpATK</small><b>20+</b><span>a média é 16,5</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de HP e SpDEF</small><b>16+</b><span>define quanto aguenta antes da poção</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de SPD</small><b>livre</b><span>só encurta a recarga</span></div>\n   </div>\n   <div><b>Para comparar dois Abra</b><ol class=\"prio\"><li>Maior qualidade.</li><li>Empate de qualidade (até 0,05): maior IV de SpATK.</li><li>Depois IV de HP e SpDEF.</li><li>P2 e P3 desempatam. P4, P5 ou shiny passam na frente de tudo.</li></ol></div>\n   <div class=\"mult\">\n    <div class=\"mlab\"><b>Bate forte</b><small>esses tipos apanham ×2+ dos golpes dele</small></div>\n    <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#b0483f\"><i></i>Lutador<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9a5c9a\"><i></i>Veneno<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#5d84cf\"><i></i>Água<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9a8fd6\"><i></i>Voador<em>×2</em></span></div>\n    <div class=\"mlab\"><b>Sofre de</b><small>esses tipos batem ×2,5+ nele</small></div>\n    <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#98a83a\"><i></i>Inseto<em>×2,5</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#73659a\"><i></i>Fantasma<em>×2,5</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#6f6258\"><i></i>Sombrio<em>×2,5</em></span></div>\n   </div>"
    },
    "escada": {
      "html": "<div class=\"escada\"><div class=\"degrau eu\" style=\"height:146.8px;--a:10%\"><span class=\"pin\">você · Nv 100</span>\n      <small>base</small><span class=\"dn\">Abra</span><span class=\"bst\">310</span><small>BST · Psíquico</small></div><div class=\"degrau \" style=\"height:172px;--a:28%\"><span class=\"salto\">Nv 50 · +29%</span>\n      <small>evolui no Nv 50</small><span class=\"dn\">Kadabra</span><span class=\"bst\">400</span><small>BST · Psíquico</small></div><div class=\"degrau \" style=\"height:200px;--a:46%\"><span class=\"salto\">Nv 100 · +25%</span>\n      <small>evolui no Nv 100</small><span class=\"dn\">Alakazam</span><span class=\"bst\">500</span><small>BST · Psíquico</small></div></div><div class=\"escada-base\"></div>\n    <p class=\"escada-prog\">Seu Abra já tem nível para virar <b>Kadabra</b> (Nv 50): o BST sobe 29%. Fonte: guia da comunidade; confirme a seta \"Precisa de Nv X\" no jogo antes de gastar pedra.</p>"
    },
    "hunt-lede": {
      "text": "60 hunts entre o Nv 60 e o Nv 110 simuladas com o seu exemplar. 57 são seguras (no pior intervalo de 5 s ele leva menos de 50% do HP). No topo ficam as que somam mais abates por hora em hunts de nível mais alto, que pagam mais."
    },
